OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan due to arrive
OL,4,Ain UK today
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,7,Farriving back in the UK today, BBC News
OL,8,Funderstands.
OL,10,FPrince Harry, Meghan and their two
OL,11,Fchildren are believed to be flying into
OL,12,Fthe country privately from California.
OL,14,FA spokesman for the Duke and Duchess of
OL,15,FSussex said "this is not something we
OL,16,Fwould comment on".
OL,18,FThey will not return to official duties
OL,19,Fbut will live in Britain as private
OL,20,Fcitizens and non-working royals.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
