OL,3,APakistani PM suspends top health
OL,4,Aofficial after 14 newborn babies killed
OL,5,Ain hospital fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FPakistani Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif
OL,8,Fhas suspended a top health official
OL,9,Fafter 14 newborn babies died in a fire
OL,10,Fat an Islamabad hospital's maternity
OL,11,Funit
OL,13,FThe fire broke out in an
OL,14,Fair-conditioning unit in PIMS hospital,
OL,15,Fand was quickly ignited by oxygen
OL,16,Fconnections, a spokesperson tells BBC
OL,17,FUrdu
OL,19,FOf the 15 babies who were in the ward
OL,20,Fat the time, one newborn has been
OL,21,Frescued, a hospital spokesperson tells
OL,22,Fthe BBC
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
