OL,3,APakistani PM suspends top health
OL,4,Aofficial after 14 newborn babies killed
OL,5,Ain hospital fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FFamilies have gathered outside the
OL,8,Fhospital - many in tears, says our
OL,9,Fcorrespondent who is on the scene. One
OL,10,Fman tells the BBC his three-day-old
OL,11,Fbaby has died
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
