OL,3,ASeventeen dead and hundreds unaccounted
OL,4,Afor as flash flood hits Nepal-Tibet
OL,5,Aborder
OL,6,
OL,7,FSearch operations are under way on both
OL,8,Fsides of the border between Tibet and
OL,9,FNepal and 12 people have been rescued
OL,10,Fso far.
OL,12,FState media in China, which controls
OL,13,FTibet, say there are significant
OL,14,Fcasualties and Nepalese officials said
OL,15,Fthey anticipate "huge scale loss".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
